  "notes": "Glenway Avenue: the long E-W avenue at y~1635 is labelled only 'AVENUE' in this strip; it is the continuation of Glenway (labelled near x 1200). Woodlawn Avenue: the N-S avenue at x~9370 is labelled 'AVENUE' at Glenway and 'WOODLAWN' only south of Price; taken as one street. Elberon Avenue: the avenue along the east edge is labelled 'AVENUE' in the north and 'ELBERON' near Osage; taken as one street. Fairbanks Avenue jogs at Warsaw (north leg x~8949, south leg x~8868, labelled 'AVE.'): two T picks. Wells Street jogs at Warsaw (north leg x~8372, south leg x~8462): two T picks. Mansion Avenue jogs at Brevier: the diagonal north leg meets Brevier at x~9902, the straight south leg leaves at x~9810: two T picks. Foley Street starts at Brevier (corner, no street north of Brevier). Elberon at Warsaw: north and south legs offset ~40 px, one cross pick at the middle. '?' at (8345,557): the 20-ft diagonal road (no printed name) running NE from Lehman Road's west end to the plate top and SW toward Wells Street's north end near (8240,1075) (outside the strip; not picked). '?' at (10045,5771): short street east of Elberon at the plate edge, label cut ('W.' and '8' visible). West 8th Street name taken from the instructions (bottom street labelled 'STREET' and 'VIADUCT' here). Yellow and grey/green bands along lot lines (e.g. x~8700 north of Glenway, y~1990 west of Foley) are boundary bands, not streets. West Liberty Street's centre is near the plate's top edge (only its south half shows); y~150 estimated from its south edge."
